> # ---- Zero-inflation equation: is any fit degenerate? ----
> # Added 2026-10-17 so the log records which fits run to the boundary
> # (zero-inflation coefficients in the tens or hundreds, standard errors huge
> # or not computable). A degenerate fit's count p-values cannot be trusted.
> # This prints a diagnostic only; it changes no estimate and no verdict.
